## Filter conditions are a set

Filter conditions are unordered. Zabbix does not preserve the order they are
submitted in, and does not return them consistently across versions: 6.0
returns them in submission order, 7.2 and later sorted by formula id. `condition`
is therefore a `TypeSet` and cannot be indexed.

Under every `evaltype` but `"custom"`, Zabbix assigns the formula ids itself
and 7.2+ rejects a request that supplies them — so `condition.id` stays empty
and must not be set. With `evaltype = "custom"` you set `id` on each condition
and reference those ids from `formula`; Zabbix renumbers them into the order
they first appear in the formula, so write the formula in that order or it will
be read back rewritten.

